sie nicht, bevor wir wissen, wem sie gehört.","speaker":"Sinje","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_025_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-25-stellung-von-nicht","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Klar, aber ich schaue nicht in das Geld, nur nach einem Ausweis.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_025_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-25-stellung-von-nicht","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Gut.","speaker":"Sinje","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_025_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-25-stellung-von-nicht","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Und wir bringen sie nicht zur Polizei, sondern rufen erst den Besitzer an.","speaker":"Sinje","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_025_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-25-stellung-von-nicht","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-25-stellung-von-nicht","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Sinje, schau, jemand hat hier eine Geldbörse liegen lassen.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_025_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-25-stellung-von-nicht","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Wir öffnen sie nicht, bevor wir wissen, wem sie gehört.","speaker":"Sinje","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_025_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-25-stellung-von-nicht","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Klar, aber ich schaue nicht in das Geld, nur nach einem Ausweis.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_025_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-25-stellung-von-nicht","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Gut. Und wir bringen sie nicht zur Polizei, sondern rufen erst den Besitzer an.","speaker":"Sinje","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_025_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Wir öffnen sie nicht, bevor wir wissen, wem sie gehört.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-25-stellung-von-nicht","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-25-stellung-von-nicht","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Ihr findet eine Geldbörse. Sag, was ihr nicht macht.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Ich habe das Geld nicht gezählt, ich habe nur nachgesehen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-25-stellung-von-nicht","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-25-stellung-von-nicht","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Deine Freundin denkt, du hast das Geld schon gezählt. Korrigiere sie.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Ich behalte das Kleingeld nicht. Das wäre Betrug.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-25-stellung-von-nicht","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-25-stellung-von-nicht","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Ein Bekannter sagt, du hättest sie behalten. Widersprich.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Ich toleriere das nicht, mein Gewissen lässt das nicht zu.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-25-stellung-von-nicht","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-25-stellung-von-nicht","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Deine Kollegin fragt, ob du die Sache tolerierst.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"